    "notes": "SUMMARY:\nMON faces a major supply event Nov 24 (16.61B tokens, ~$500M at current prices); current circulating supply only 11.83B. DEX volume collapsed 35.6% day-over-day. USDC yields on Monad are material (Accountable lending at 10.86% APY on 74.98M TVL). Monad TVL down 3.05% 7d to $1.001B despite ecosystem claims. Pool depth at Uniswap v4 shows light liquidity for $10k trades (33.1 bps impact ex-fee). MON's 24h volatility is 46.4% but 30d is 110.4%, showing elevated recent swings.\n\nCHANGES:\n1. MON_UNLOCK_SUPPLY (HIGH): Nov 24 unlock exceeds current circulating supply; team (10.7B), investor (5.3B), treasury (1.07B). Largest supply event since launch. Value ~$495-520M at current price (market, 2026-10-10).\n2. MONAD_DEX_VOLUME_DROP (MEDIUM): Volume fell 35.6% 1d to $33.9M, Uniswap V4 at $20.8M. Liquidity stress visible (market, 2026-10-10).\n3. USDC_YIELD_ON_MONAD (MEDIUM): Accountable USDC lending 10.86% APY (100.6M TVL); Aave SYRUPUSDC at 1.25% APY (151.5M TVL). Concrete yield opportunity for cash. (market, defillama_yields, 2026-10-10).\n4. MON_PRICE_VOLATILITY (LOW): 30d realized vol 110.4%, 7d 95.5%. Recent swing from $0.033 to $0.0253 below support levels (market, 2026-10-10).\n\nTHEMES:\n- MON_UNLOCK_SUPPLY (materiality: HIGH, scope: MARKET, token: null, symbol: MON): supply risk on Nov 24 drives near-term caution. (sources: bitcoinfoundation.org, altcoinbuzz.io, market_snapshot).\n- MONAD_DEX_VOLUME_DROP (materiality: MEDIUM, scope: MARKET, token: null, symbol: null): 35.6% "
